    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Liberty Blue Estate Agents are delighted to introduce Clover Lawn at Summerfields, an exciting new collection of 2, 3 and 4-bedroom energy-efficient homes in Waterford.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern living, Clover Lawn brings together contemporary design, practical layouts, generous living spaces and energy-efficient construction in a well-connected location within easy reach of Waterford City.\r\n\r\nWhether you're taking your first step onto the property ladder, making a fresh start or looking for a home that better suits the next stage of your life, Clover Lawn offers a range of thoughtfully designed homes created for real life.\r\n\r\nThe Clover Lawn collection comprises four thoughtfully designed house types:\r\n\r\nThe Hawthorn – 2 Bedroom Semi-Detached.\r\nA cleverly planned two-bedroom home with open-plan kitchen and living space, two well-proportioned bedrooms, separate utility, downstairs WC and clever storage.\r\n\r\nHomes at Clover Lawn have been designed with energy efficiency, comfort and practicality in mind.\r\n\r\nFeatures include A0 BER ratings, air-to-water heat pumps, mechanical ventilation, low-energy lighting, EV charging point pre-wiring, contemporary fitted kitchens, modern sanitaryware and excellent storage.\r\n\r\nRear gardens will be fenced, levelled and seeded, with outside lighting, tap and socket also provided.\r\n\r\nNew Starter Home Scheme\r\n\r\nClover Lawn will offer private homes for owner occupation to eligible purchasers through the Starter Home Purchase Scheme.\r\n\r\nThe scheme is designed to help bridge the gap between what an eligible purchaser can afford through their mortgage and deposit and the market value of their new home. Eligible first-time buyers may also be able to avail of Help to Buy, subject to the relevant criteria, terms and conditions.\r\n\r\nProspective purchasers should begin by checking their eligibility and arranging Mortgage Approval in Principle (AIP). Applications will then be made through the Waterford City & County Council Starter Homes Portal.\r\n\r\nYour Next Chapter Starts Here\r\n\r\nA brand-new home. Your own front door. A place to settle in and make your own.\r\n\r\nDownload the Clover Lawn brochure and register for updates today.\r\n\r\nFor further information, contact the Liberty Blue New Homes Team on 051 85 81 82\r\n\r\n***All particulars, specifications, dimensions and measurements are provided for guidance purposes only and are approximate. House designs, layouts, finishes, landscaping and specifications may be subject to change during the course of construction.\r\n\r\nInterior photographs used are of the Heather 3-bedroom semi-detached show house and may include finishes, furnishings, fixtures and fittings that are not included as standard. Exterior images of the development may include CGI-generated imagery. All photographs, CGI images and other visual representations are for illustrative purposes only and may differ from the completed homes and development.\r\n\r\nProspective purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the final specification, dimensions and layout of their chosen property prior to entering into a contract. These particulars do not form part of any contract and are subject to contract..***"
      },
